  "title": "고무밴드로 힘의 합성 실험하기",
  "author": "정현주(경기)",
  "userid": "alVk",
  "created": "17.04.21",
  "viewCnt": 1391,
  "commentCnt": 13,
  "headCont": "",
  "contentval": "000D7zzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/813",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2128EE3B58F97CA92D\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2128EE3B58F97CA92D\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"405\"></div><p>다이#에서 구입한 <br>1000원짜리 고무밴드와 슈파핀으로 <br>힘의 합성 실험을 해볼까합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/25561A3358F97CAA0E\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/25561A3358F97CAA0E\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"405\"></div><p>그래프 용지 위에<br>한쪽은 슈파핀을 책상에 박고 <br>가운데는 기준점을 알려주는 핀을 밴드에만 꽂았습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/242F553658F97CAB1A\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/242F553658F97CAB1A\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"404\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/221BBA3458F97CAC29\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/221BBA3458F97CAC29\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"404\"></div><p>힘의 크기에 따라 밴드가 늘어난 길이를 확인합니다. <br><br>늘어난 길이 = 힘의 크기. 이죠.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2466B63558F97CAD10\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2466B63558F97CAD10\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"405\"></div><p>합성을 알아보기 위해<br><br>밴드를 반으로 잘라봅니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2536033758F97CAE18\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2536033758F97CAE18\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"404\"></div><p>잘린 양쪽 밴드를 같은 길이로 당겨봅니다. <br><br>같은 길이 = 같은 힘의 크기. 입니다. <br><br>이 때 각도에 따라 기준점에서 늘어난 밴드의 길이(파란색)를 측정해봅니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2342973A58F97CAF16\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2342973A58F97CAF16\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"404\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2658D13658F97CAF18\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2658D13658F97CAF18\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"404\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/264BC23858F97CB039\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/264BC23858F97CB039\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"404\"></div><p>각도에 따라 힘의 합성 크기를 간단히 비교할 수 있는 것 같습니다.</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
